- Stage 4: producer provenance and all hashes match; exact empty obligation bijection; no generated target.
- Fresh trusted preflight: `lake clean` and `lake build` passed after a documented PID-namespace environment repair.
- Stage 5: correctly absent in `CLASSIFICATION_ONLY` mode.

Final result: `PASS / LEGIT`.

- [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)
- [Evidence and commands](/audit-output/evidence/COMMANDS.md)
